 "transcript": "So Claude can now test your stock trade 10 ,000 times before you risk a single dollar. Someone just open sourced 11 free day trading skills for Claude and each one handles a different job. One skill scans thousands of stock charts looking for trading opportunities. Another tracks breaking news that could move those stocks. Then there's an entry skill that watches for the right signal and an exit skill that plans when to take profit or cut your losses. But the craziest one is called the time machine. It takes your trade and simulates the rest of the trading day 10 ,000 times using historical price data. Then it shows how often you would have made money, hit your stop loss or ended somewhere in between. So you get to see the historical odds before putting your money on the line. Of course, it's a simulation, not a guarantee. To get all 11 skills and the full setup guide, follow Build With AI and comment trade.",
